# Root-cause proof — always apply

Before declaring a root cause anywhere — for a production incident, a bug RCA, or a "why is X
broken/slow/failing" investigation — run
[`root-cause-proof/SKILL.md`](../skills/root-cause-proof/SKILL.md) and satisfy its evidence
checklist before labeling anything "confirmed."

## Forbidden

- Writing "confirmed" without running the skill's checklist — label the cause hypothesis instead.
- Citing a prior incident, or a code path recalled from memory, as proof rather than as a lead to
  re-derive against this incident's live evidence and current source.
